## Layout

All paths below are relative to `{{ .contextRoot }}`.
{{ if eq .profile "work" }}
```
projects/<project>/
  plans/<plan>.md
  research/<topic>.md
knowledge/
  research/<topic>.md
  technical/
  references/repos.md      ← repo registry
setup/                    ← private work-machine setup notes
```

Company content only. Never put personal journals, schedules, identity, finances,
family notes, or previous-employer material here. Do not depend on a personal
context checkout or enable automatic commit/push for this repository.
{{ else }}

```
inbox.md
schedules/<YYYY>/
  <YYYY-MM-DD>.md          ← daily
  <YYYY-MM-DD>-week.md     ← weekly (Monday date)
journal/<YYYY>/<MM>/<YYYY-MM-DD>.md
identity/goals/
  <yyyy>.md, <yyyy>-Q<n>.md
identity/
  5-year-plan.md, career-strategy.md, board-of-directors.md
  daily-schedule.md
  health-and-energy.md, marriage-and-family.md, friendships.md, wealth-strategy.md
strategies/
  ideas.md, *.md
projects/personal/<project>/
  plans/<plan>.md, plans/done/
  research/<topic>.md
knowledge/
  research/<topic>.md
  references/repos.md      ← repo registry
```

Personal content only. Do not read or write company context through this profile.
Legacy company files awaiting migration are not destinations for new work.
For company tasks, stop and use the work profile rather than choosing a fallback.
{{ end }}
These are conventions, not a promise that every optional file exists. Inspect the
context repository before creating files; preserve existing formats and layouts.

## Retired task lists

Legacy todo lists, archives, and habit lists were removed as stale by request.
Do not reconstruct them from history or create replacement task files without an
explicit request. Do not archive into the deleted lists. Existing inbox, journals,
and schedules are historical context, not automatically current task queues.

{{ if eq .profile "work" -}}
## Linear conventions

- `assignee: "me"` for current user.
- Priority map: `P0=Urgent(1)`, `P1=High(2)`, `P2=Medium(3)`, `P3=Low(4)`.
- Never auto-complete or auto-transition status.
{{ end }}

## Repo resolution

Read the repo registry named in the installed profile context.

Bare-repo layout (has `.bare/`): work in `~/src/<repo>/main`. Standard repos: `~/src/<repo>`.

Don't guess silently — ambiguous topic → list candidates and ask.

## Universal rules

- Never fabricate entries, findings, or sources.
- Never auto-complete the user's todos or Linear issues.
- Always present drafts and get confirmation before destructive writes.
- Surgical writes only — touch only the files the skill is meant to touch.
- Preserve the user's voice; don't embellish prose.
